From 313d916dd07aff8c17fe74c1e17129c9822971b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: coalesce batch mempool and P2P transaction bursts

Coalesce high-rate P2P and RPC transaction bursts into amortized validation and
relay batches (`AcceptMultipleTransactions`, batched `INV` announcement queueing,
and compact `CTxMemPoolEntry` layout) to reduce lock acquisition overhead under load.
